.TH "INSPEKT\-VIEWPORT" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-viewport \- Get or set browser viewport dimensions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]viewport\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get or set browser viewport dimensions.
.PP
Without arguments, shows the current viewport size.
With a number, sets the width.
With two numbers, sets width and height.
.PP
Subcommands: mobile, tablet, desktop, wide, wider, narrower.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output as JSON
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\f[B]desktop\f[R]
Set viewport to 1280px width (standard desktop).
.TP
\f[B]fit\f[R]
Fit viewport to the VNC canvas size (VM only).
.TP
\f[B]mobile\f[R]
Set viewport to 375px width (iPhone SE / small mobile).
.TP
\f[B]narrower\f[R]
Shrink viewport width.
.TP
\f[B]tablet\f[R]
Set viewport to 768px width (iPad portrait / tablet).
.TP
\f[B]wide\f[R]
Set viewport to 1920px width (Full HD / wide desktop).
.TP
\f[B]wider\f[R]
Grow viewport width.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt viewport
inspekt viewport 1024
inspekt viewport 1024 768
inspekt viewport 1024 auto
inspekt viewport mobile
inspekt viewport wider
